  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The diagram shows the trajectories of two projectiles, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\"></span>, which are launched from the same location on level ground with the same initial speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span>. Air resistance is negligible.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which statement correctly compares the motion of projectile <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> with projectile <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> has a longer time of flight than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\"></span>.</p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p>The vertical component of the initial velocity is smaller for <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> than for <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\"></span>.</p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p>The horizontal component of the velocity is larger for <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> than for <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q\"></span>.</p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p>The acceleration of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span> at its highest point is zero.</p></li></ol>"
  },
